<h1>You cannot get a single person discount</h1>

<p>This discount is only for homes where one adult lives.</p>

<h2>You might get a different discount</h2>
<p>Some adults aren't counted for council tax. If everyone else aged 18 or over who lives with you is one of these, you could still get money off your bill:</p>
<ul class="p-list">
  <li>full-time students and student nurses</li>
  <li>apprentices and people aged 18 or 19 in full-time education</li>
  <li>live-in carers</li>
  <li>people with a severe mental impairment</li>
</ul>

<p><a href="#">Apply for a discount because someone living with you isn't counted</a> (not part of this prototype)</p>

<p>If someone has moved in recently, <a href="#">tell us about a change to who lives in your home</a>.</p>
